      "caption": null,
      "dur": 19.587,
      "mg": "Problem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip": "s01-01",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 6.438,
          "en": "Chile ships USD 2.8 billion of cherries a season, almost all of it to China.",
          "zh": "智利每季出口28亿美元樱桃，几乎全部销往中国。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s01-01.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s01-02",
          "start": 6.758,
          "end": 10.84,
          "en": "The fruit arrives in three weeks. The money takes months.",
          "zh": "水果三周就到，货款却要等上几个月。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s01-02.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s01-03",
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 15.08,
          "en": "For a family exporter, one late payment can mean missing payroll.",
          "zh": "对家族出口商来说，一笔货款迟到，就可能发不出工资。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s01-03.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s01-04",
          "start": 15.4,
          "end": 18.437,
          "en": "And most of them have no finance team to see it coming.",
          "zh": "而大多数出口商没有财务团队来提前预警。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s01-04.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        }
      ],
      "chapterStart": true
    },
