          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 8.83,
          "en": "Meet Huerto Austral, a fictional cherry exporter, and NanFeng: an AI CFO that acts with the owner's approval.",
          "zh": "这是虚构的樱桃出口商 Huerto Austral，以及南风：经企业主批准才行动的 AI CFO。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s02-01-ai.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s02-04",
          "start": 9.13,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "Then, bad news from Shanghai: the buyer will pay USD 180,000 45 days late.",
          "zh": "随后传来上海的坏消息：买家的18万美元货款将延迟45天支付。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/v3/s02-04.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        }
      ],
